                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo watumishi wa Farao wakamwambia, Mtu huyu atakuwa tanzi kwetu sisi hata lini? Wape hawa watu ruhusa waende zao, wamtumikie BWANA, Mungu wao; hujatambua bado ya kuwa Misri imekwisha haribika? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa na Haruni wakaletwa tena kwa Farao; naye akawaambia, Nendeni, mkamtumikie BWANA, Mungu wenu; lakini ni kina nani watakaokwenda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
