          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao akamwambia Musa, Nenda zako, ujiangalie, usinione uso tena; kwani siku hiyo utakayoniangalia uso wangu utakufa. ",
          "type": "text",
